# catalog/lane-run-inputs.d/pr-url-reconcile.ro — what one
# `bin/pr-url-reconcile.sh --project $p` run reads and never writes back.
# The snapshot is pr-url-reconcile.rw plus these lines. The file:line after
# each entry is where the run reads it.
#
# The record files read only:
#   review.md                     verdict_of :335
#   ticket-meta.json              restack_orphan :652
#   pr-body.md                    restack_orphan :657, :667
#   .blocked-resolver-abandoned   the walk :741
#   .blocked-resolver-superseded  the walk :754
# A token name of its own: a second <record file> would replace the .rw one.
@token <read file> review.md ticket-meta.json pr-body.md .blocked-resolver-abandoned .blocked-resolver-superseded
builds/$p-<KEY>-*/<read file>
builds/pool-$p-<KEY>-*/<read file>
builds/fly-$p-<KEY>-*/<read file>
# bin/pr-url-reconcile.sh:179, :268, :321 (bin/fleet-conf.sh)
fleet.conf
# bin/pr-url-reconcile.sh:401 (flags/merge-conductor-actions), bin/lib/lane-gate.sh
flags/*
